<div class="finance-fields"><div class="field"><label>每月账单日</label><input type="number" name="bill_day" min="1" max="31" value="<%= profile.bill_day %>" required></div><div class="field"><label>每月还款日</label><input type="number" name="due_day" min="1" max="31" value="<%= profile.due_day %>" required></div><div class="field"><label>还款月份</label><select name="due_month_offset"><% ['账单当月','账单次月','账单后两个月'].forEach((s,i)=>{ %><option value="<%= i %>" <%= Number(profile.due_month_offset)===i?'selected':'' %>><%= s %></option><% }); %></select></div></div>
<div class="field"><label>到期提醒</label><select name="remind_enabled"><option value="1" <%= profile.remind_enabled?'selected':'' %>>开启</option><option value="0" <%= !profile.remind_enabled?'selected':'' %>>关闭</option></select></div><p class="help">月末自动钳到当月最后一天。修改账期从最后已确认账单的次日生效。</p>

<div class="field"><label>期初余额所属出账日（可选）</label><input type="date" name="opening_closing" value="<%= profile.opening_closing||'' %>" <%= profile.opening_closing?'readonly':'' %>></div><p class="help">期初负债仅归入指定账单，不生成消费；首次留空归入本期。</p>
